, a quarter of the bar`,!1),W(4,`a bar 6 by 8 without counting, and three quarters of it`,!1)]},{id:`hop-pattern`,subject:`maths`,name:`Skip counting: where the runaway lands next`,friend:`bunny`,known:!0,rungs:[W(1,`hops of 2, 5 or 10 from the start: 2, 4, 6`),W(1,`hops of 2, 5 or 10 from another start: 3, 5, 7`),W(2,`hops of 3 and 4: 3, 6, 9`),W(2,`hopping back by 2, 5 or 10: 20, 18, 16`),W(2,`bigger numbers: by tens from 37, by fives and twos past 100`),W(3,`two hops ahead: where is he after two more hops?`),W(3,`threes and fours hopping back, or from any start: 30, 27, 24`),W(3,`a hop that grows: 1, 3, 6, 10`,!1),W(4,`two runaways, by twos and by threes: where do both land?`,!1)]},{id:`equal-parts`,subject:`maths`,name:`Cutting into equal parts`,friend:`puppy`,known:!0,rungs:[W(1,`halves: two pieces the same size`),W(1,`halves and fourths`),W(2,`thirds, asked by name`),W(2,`half of a set: half of 8 dumplings`,!1),W(3,`pieces written as 1/2, 1/3, 1/4, and eighths`,!1),W(3,`which piece is bigger? the same amount two ways (2/4 is 1/2)`,!1),W(4,`a fraction of a set: 3/4 of 12`,!1)],next:`name-parts`},{id:`name-parts`,subject:`maths`,name:`Naming the pieces`,friend:`puppy`,known:!0,needs:{skill:`equal-parts`,rung:0},rungs:[W(1,`one half or one fourth`),W(2,`one third; how many make the whole?`),W(3,`two of four pieces: two fourths`,!1)]},{id:`fair-shares`,subject:`maths`,name:`Cutting fair shares`,friend:`puppy`,known:!0,rungs:[W(1,`halves: one cut right through the middle (a dotted line shows where)`),W(1,`fourths: two cuts through the middle`),W(2,`thirds: three cuts from the middle out to the edge`),W(3,`eighths: four friends, two pieces each`),W(2,`a pan in rows and columns: 2, 3, 4 or 6 pieces`,!1),W(3,`which is bigger, one third or one fourth? from the real pieces`,!1),W(3,`a fraction of a set: half of the 6 cupcakes`,!1)]},{id:`read-digraphs`,subject:`reading`,name:`Words with ch, sh, th, wh`,friend:`kitty`,known:!0,next:`read-soft-c-g`,rungs:[W(1,`three jars 