 what the drops do`),dropsHold:$(`ube`,n(`Hold {his} head, gently and still.`),`eye-care: hold the head`),dropsTip:$(`ube`,n(`The tip must never touch {his} eye.`),`eye-care: the tip never touches`),dropsPet:$(`ube`,n(`All done. Let's pet {him}.`),`eye-care: pet her`),clockTimes:$(`ube`,n(`{His} drops go in 4 times a day for now.`),`drop-clock: the plan`),clockSet:$(`ube`,`Let's set the clock for each time.`,`drop-clock: set the clock`),clock7:$(`ube`,`Set the clock to 7 o'clock.`,`drop-clock: set to 7`),clock11:$(`ube`,`Set the clock to 11 o'clock.`,`drop-clock: set to 11`),clock3:$(`ube`,`Set the clock to 3 o'clock.`,`drop-clock: set to 3`),clockShort:$(`ube`,`The short hand points to the hour.`,`drop-clock: the short hand`),clockThanks:$(t.owner,`Thank you! Now I know when.`,`drop-clock: the owner thanks`),washHands:$(`ube`,`This germ can pass to other cats. We wash our hands after.`,`wash-hands: wash hands`)},facts:{eye:{side:e.side??`left`,sign:!0},clock:{times:[7,11,3,7],names:[`Breakfast`,`Late morning`,`After school`,`Bedtime`]}}}}},fie={id:`tick`,source:`CATALOGUE.md I16`,sides:[`left`,`right`],sideSource:`tick.md 3: no opened page ties a tick to a side (which ear is free; no line names it)`,canonical:{patient:`max`,temperatureF:101.5,temperatureC:38.6},groups:{dog:{sources:[`vet/design/cases/tick.md`,`https://www.merckvetmanual.com/dog-owners/skin-disorders-of-dogs/ticks-of-dogs`,`https://vcahospitals.com/know-your-pet/ticks-in-dogs`,`https://www.petmd.com/dog/general-health/7-common-bug-bites-dogs`,`https://bondvet.com/blog/dog-skin-tags`,`https://yourpetandyou.elanco.com/us/parasites/ticks/how-to-tell-if-your-dog-has-a-tick-or-scab-or-skin-tag`],fits:{lifestyle:{any:[`walks-long-grass`,`garden`],why:`[m-ticks-dog] keep away from "tick-prone areas"; tall grass and weeds (tick.md 3)`}}},cat:{sources:[`vet/design/cases/tick.md`,`https://www.merckvetmanual.com/cat-owners/skin-disorders-of-cats/ticks-of-cats`,`https://vcahospitals.com/know-your-pet/ticks-in-c