, let's trim the hair around {his} ears.`),`ear-clean: trim`),cleanTrimWhy:$(`ube`,`Short hair makes cleaning easier.`,`ear-clean: why trim`),cleanWhich:$(`ube`,`Which one do we clean ears with?`,`ear-clean: cotton ball or swab`),cleanNotSwab:$(`ube`,`Not a swab. It pushes wax deeper.`,`ear-clean: the swab picked`),cleanCotton:$(`ube`,`Cotton balls! They soak up the wax.`,`ear-clean: the cotton ball picked`),cleanFill:$(`ube`,n(`Now some ear cleaner. Fill {his} ear.`),`ear-clean: fill`),cleanSquish:$(`ube`,n(`Rub gently at the bottom of {his} ear. Listen for the squish!`),`ear-clean: the squish`),cleanWipe:$(`ube`,`Now wipe the wax out with the cotton.`,`ear-clean: wipe`),cleanOther:$(`ube`,`Now the other ear.`,`ear-clean: the other ear`),cleanWait:$(`ube`,`We wait a few minutes before the drops.`,`ear-clean: wait`),cleanPet:$(`ube`,n(`Let's pet {him} while we wait.`),`ear-clean: pet while we wait`),dropsVet:$(`ube`,`These drops are from the vet. I'll put them in.`,`ear-clean: the drops`),dropsJob:$(`ube`,`They fight the yeast and calm the red skin.`,`ear-clean: what the drops do`),dropsCoat:$(`ube`,n(`The drops coat the inside of {his} ear.`),`ear-clean: the drops coat`)},facts:{ears:{sore:`left`,both:!0,finding:{left:`red, brown wax`,right:`red, brown wax`}},slide:{sample:`ear-swab`,put:`roll`,prep:`stain`,field:{kind:`yeast`},count:{thing:`yeast`,n:r,from:JS[0],to:JS[JS.length-1],source:`[angus-cyto] "Mean counts greater than 5 yeast per field in dogs ... are abnormal" (yeast-ears.md 5e)`},sources:[`[m-otitis] "Exudate obtained with a cotton-tipped applicator should be rolled onto a glass slide, stained ..., and examined under a microscope."`,`[vettimes-guide] "stain dark blue-purple with a characteristic peanut or footprint shape"`]}}}}},JS=[12,13,14,15,16,17,18,19,20],YS=[OS,tS,ES,KS,qS,nS,iS,fie,_ie,bre,mie,pie,die,WS,Wre],XS=YS.map(e=>$x(e,Gx(e))),ZS=e=>YS.find(t=>t.id===e);function QS(e){let[t,n,r]=e.split(`:`);if(n===void 0)return{illness:t,patient:null,see