 that one already. See my paw?`,`ward: a task with Ube Ube’s paw tapped`),emptyKennel:$(`ube`,`This room is free. A pet can stay here.`,`ward: a free room tapped`),tomorrow:$(`ube`,`A new friend comes tomorrow.`,`ward: the quiet kennel is empty`),...gw,...Qie,cardAsk:$(`ube`,`Let's write her name on her card.`,`card: what to do`),cardBig:$(`ube`,`A name starts with a big letter. Which one?`,`card: the big letter`),cardShowBig:$(`ube`,`This is the big one. Names start big.`,`card: the small letter picked`),cardWrite:$(`ube`,`Tap the card, and the pen writes her name.`,`card: just doing`),hayAsk:$(`ube`,`Rabbits eat lots and lots of hay. Fill her rack!`,`hay: what to do`),hayMore:$(`ube`,`More! She can have as much as she wants.`,`hay: still room in the rack`),hayDone:$(`ube`,`Full! Hay keeps her tummy moving.`,`hay: the rack is full`),greensOne:$(`ube`,`Her card says one cup of greens.`,`greens: the morning card`),greensHalf:$(`ube`,`Her card says half a cup of greens.`,`greens: the evening card`),greensFill:$(`ube`,`Press and hold the greens. Let go at the line.`,`greens: what to do`),greensLine:$(`ube`,`Look at the line on the cup.`,`greens: the line, shown`),greensTooMuch:$(`ube`,`Oops, too much. Let's tip a little back.`,`greens: past the line`),greensTooLittle:$(`ube`,`A little more. Up to the line.`,`greens: under the line`),greensTip:$(`ube`,`Just right! Now tip it in her bowl.`,`greens: at the line`),eatSniff:$(`ube`,`She sniffs it. She is not very hungry yet.`,`greens: day one, poorly`),eatNibble:$(`ube`,`She nibbles a leaf. Good!`,`greens: day two, getting better`),eatAll:$(`ube`,`Yum! She is eating it all up.`,`greens: day three, well`),countAsk:$(`ube`,`Let's count her poops. Tap each one.`,`count: what to do`),countHow:$(`ube`,`How many poops did you count?`,`count: the question`),countShow:$(`ube`,`Let's count them again together.`,`count: a wrong pick`),countFour:$(`ube`,`Four. Only a few. Her tummy is slow.`,`count: day one`),countTwelve:$(`ube`,`Twelve! Yesterday was four. That is eight more!`,`count: day two`),countTens:$(`ube`,`Three rows of ten. Ten, twenty, thirty!`,`count: day three, in tens`),countThirty:$(`ube`,`Thirty! More than yesterday. Her tummy is waking up.`,`count: day three`),countBar:$(`ube`,`Her bar on the chart grows.`,`count: the bar on the chart`),weighAsk:$(`ube`,`Weigh-in first, before breakfast. Hop on!`,`weigh: onto the scale`),weighRead:$(`ube`,`How many kilograms is she?`,`weigh: the question`),weighShow:$(`ube`,`Look. The needle points at the 2.`,`weigh: a wrong pick, shown`),weighSame:$(`ube`,`Two kilograms. Not less. That is good news!`,`weigh: the answer`),weighDot:$(`ube`,`Put today’s dot on her chart.`,`weigh: the chart`),weighFlat:$(`ube`,`Her line stays flat. She is not losing weight.`,`weigh: the dot is on`),listenAsk:$(`ube`,`Let's listen to her tummy. Put this on it.`,`listen: the stethoscope`),listenQuiet:$(`ube`,`Shh. Listen.`,`listen: listening`),listenNone:$(`ube`,`Very quiet. Her tummy is not moving food along.`,`listen: day one`),listenSome:$(`ube`,`A gurgle! Her tummy is moving again.`,`listen: day two`),listenLots:$(`ube`,`Gurgle, gurgle! Her tummy is busy now.`,`listen: day three`),syringeAsk:$(`ube`,`I filled it with soft food. Push the pink end slowly, like this.`,`syringe: what to do`),syringeGood:$(`ube`,`She is eating it! Nice and slow.`,`syringe: pushing at the right pace`),syringeFast:$(`ube`,`Too fast. She turned away. Slowly, slowly.`,`syringe: pushed too fast`),syringeDone:$(`ube`,`All gone. She ate it all up!`,`syringe: empty`),syringeSelf:$(`ube`,`Look! She eats some by herself now.`,`syringe: day two`),comfortAsk:$(`ube`,`Pet her forehead, between her eyes. Slowly. Rabbits like that.`,`comfort: what to do`),comfortSlow:$(`ube`,`Slowly. Nice and gentle.`,`comfort: too fast`),comfortLikes:$(`ube`,`She likes it when you pet her forehead. Most rabbits do!`,`comfort: the heart is full`),friendComes:$(`ube`,`Here comes her friend. Rabbits feel safer together.`,`comfort: day one, her friend`),hayNibble:$(`ube`,`Look. She nibbles hay while you pet her.`,`comfort: day two`),playTube:$(`ube`,`She pulls the hay out. What fun!`,`play: the hay tube`),nightWard:$(`ube`,`Shh. She is asleep. Tuck her blanket in.`,`ward at night`),nightTucked:$(`ube`,`Night night. Sleep tight.`,`ward at night: tucked in`),planIntro:$(`ube`,`Here is her plan for home. Let's read it.`,`going home: the plan`),plan1:$(`ube`,`Lots of hay.`,`going home: the plan, line 1`),plan2:$(`ube`,`Greens every day.`,`going home: the plan, line 2`),plan3:$(`ube`,`Keep her friend with her.`,`going home: the plan, line 3`),plan4:$(`ube`,`Count her poops.`,`going home: the plan, line 4`),plan5:$(`ube`,`No poops? Come back the same day.`,`going home: the plan, line 5`),pill:$(`hamster`,`Can I give her my headache pill?`,`going home: the owner asks`),pillNo:$(`ube`,`No. Only medicine from the vet.`,`going home: the answer`),billAsk:$(`ube`,`The visit is 50 cents. Two nights are 20 and 20.`,`going home: the bill`),billHow:$(`ube`,`How much is that all together?`,`going home: the bill, the question`),billShow:$(`ube`,`Fifty, seventy, ninety. Ninety cents.`,`going home: the bill, shown`),pay:$(`hamster`,`Here you are. Thank you, doctor!`,`going home: the owner pays`),paid:$(`ube`,`Ninety cents in our jar!`,`going home: the coins are in`),photo:$(`ube`,`One photo for our ward wall. Smile!`,`going home: the photo`),photoUp:$(`ube`,`There she is, all better, on our wall.`,`going home: the photo on the wall`),casePage:$(`ube`,`A new page for your casebook. A tummy that stopped!`,`going home: the casebook page`),rockyMeet:$(`ube`,`This is Rocky. He lives here with us!`,`ward: the first time she sees Rocky`),rockyBreakfast:$(`ube`,`Time for Rocky's breakfast. First, fresh water.`,`Rocky's breakfast: the water`),rockyQuarter:$(`ube`,`Now one quarter cup of food.`,`Rocky's breakfast: the food`),rockyBox:$(`ube`,`Rocky's box needs scooping.`,`Rocky's litter box`),rockyDinner:$(`ub