ook.`,`xray reading: the tablet`),shadesBone:$(`ube`,`White is bone.`,`xray reading: white is bone (first time only)`),shadesSoft:$(`ube`,`Grey is soft, like muscle.`,`xray reading: grey is soft (first time only)`),shadesAir:$(`ube`,`Black is air.`,`xray reading: black is air (first time only)`),findLungs:$(`ube`,`Air is black. Find the lungs.`,`xray reading: find the lungs`),lungsFound:$(`ube`,`The lungs are full of air. So they look black.`,`xray reading: the lungs, found`),findPipe:$(`ube`,`Now find the windpipe. It is a tube of air.`,`xray reading: find the windpipe`),pipeFound:$(`ube`,`The windpipe is open all the way down.`,`xray reading: the windpipe, found`),tapBone:$(`ube`,`That is bone. Bone is white.`,`xray reading: she tapped a bone`),tapSoft:$(`ube`,`That is soft inside. Soft is grey.`,`xray reading: she tapped something soft`),tapAir:$(`ube`,`That is air. Air is black.`,`xray reading: she tapped the dark`),countRibs:$(`ube`,`Let's count the ribs.`,`xray reading: counting the ribs`),letterR:$(`ube`,`See the R? It says which side was down: the right.`,`xray reading: the letter R`),letterL:$(`ube`,`See the L? It says which side was down: the left.`,`xray reading: the letter L`),findSock:$(`ube`,`Something is in the tummy. A grey shape with stripes. Tap it.`,`xray reading: find the swallowed thing`),sockFound:$(`ube`,`A sock! It lifts right out of the picture.`,`xray reading: the sock, found`),screen:$(`ube`,`Here are the pictures, on the big screen. Tap it to look.`,`xray reading: the big screen`),sockNext:$(`ube`,`The surgery vet will take it out. Good work, doctor!`,`xray visit: what happens to the swallowed sock`),lungsFine:$(`ube`,`The lungs look fine. Good work, doctor!`,`xray visit: the chest picture is fine`),frogHello:$(`frog`,`Hello, doctor! The owner waits downstairs.`,`xray visit step 1: the first time up to the X-ray room`),frogHelloAgain:$(`frog`,`Hello again, doctor! Time for an X-ray.`,`xray visit step 1: every time after`),frogApron:$(`fro